   Min. 1st Qu.  Median    Mean 3rd Qu.    Max. 
  8.000   9.000   9.000   9.236  10.000  10.000 

  Panel declared: opeid5_new (entity) x endyear (time)

. xtcsd, pesaran
  [R equivalent: Pesaran (2004) CD test — plm::pcdtest(test='cd')]


	Pesaran CD test for cross-sectional dependence in panels

data:  lneg ~ lnstatea + lntuition + lnfte + lnftfac + lnptfac
z = 82.069, p-value < 2.2e-16
alternative hypothesis: cross-sectional dependence


. xtcsd, friedman
  [R equivalent: Breusch-Pagan LM test — plm::pcdtest(test='lm')]
  Note: Friedman test not in current plm; 'lm' is the closest alternative.


	Breusch-Pagan LM test for cross-sectional dependence in panels

data:  lneg ~ lnstatea + lntuition + lnfte + lnftfac + lnptfac
chisq = 54911, df = 20503, p-value < 2.2e-16
alternative hypothesis: cross-sectional dependence


. xtcsd, frees
  [R equivalent: average pairwise correlation — plm::pcdtest(test='rho')]
  Note: Frees (1995) test not in plm; 'rho' reports the same statistic.


	Average correlation coefficient for cross-sectional dependence in panels

data:  lneg ~ lnstatea + lntuition + lnfte + lnftfac + lnptfac
rho = 0.19174
alternative hypothesis: cross-sectional dependence


. xtcd lneg lntuition lnftfac lnptfac
  [R equivalent: Pesaran CD test on each variable via pcdtest()]

  Variable: lneg

	Pesaran CD test for cross-sectional dependence in panels

data:  lneg ~ factor(endyear)
z = 0.029441, p-value = 0.9765
alternative hypothesis: cross-sectional dependence


