	Pesaran CD test for cross-sectional dependence in panels

data:  lntuition ~ factor(endyear)
z = -1.0291, p-value = 0.3034
alternative hypothesis: cross-sectional dependence


  Variable: lnftfac

	Pesaran CD test for cross-sectional dependence in panels

data:  lnftfac ~ factor(endyear)
z = 0.23985, p-value = 0.8104
alternative hypothesis: cross-sectional dependence


  Variable: lnptfac

	Pesaran CD test for cross-sectional dependence in panels

data:  lnptfac ~ factor(endyear)
z = 26.742, p-value < 2.2e-16
alternative hypothesis: cross-sectional dependence



